{"parse": {"title": "矢车菊说起的那一年-02", "pageid": 141915, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%9F%A2%E8%BD%A6%E8%8F%8A%E8%AF%B4%E8%B5%B7%E7%9A%84%E9%82%A3%E4%B8%80%E5%B9%B4-01\" title=\"矢车菊说起的那一年-01\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">矢车菊说起的那一年-02</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%9F%A2%E8%BD%A6%E8%8F%8A%E8%AF%B4%E8%B5%B7%E7%9A%84%E9%82%A3%E4%B8%80%E5%B9%B4-03\" title=\"矢车菊说起的那一年-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">矢车菊说起的那一年</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">02</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.8F.98.E5.B9.BB.E6.9C.88\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"变幻月\">变幻月</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 变幻月</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\"></div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"no-indent\">\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"border: 1px solid; font-size: 14px; margin: 0 5px; display: inline-block; text-align: center; height: 20px; line-height: 18px; min-width: &#91;&#91;:模板:Width&#93;&#93;; color: #666; padding: 0 5px;\">07.04.1991 云</span></div>\n<div style=\"position: relative; display: inline-block; max-width: 100%;\"><img alt=\"V3a1 rolestory game placebg.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png/400px-V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"41\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"588\" data-file-height=\"60\" />\n<div style=\"position: absolute; top: 38%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); white-space: nowrap;\"><img alt=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/15px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" width=\"15\" height=\"18\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/23px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"24\" data-file-height=\"28\" /><span style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; font-size: 14px;margin-left: 20px; color: #cccccc\">MFC快餐店员工后厨（傍晚）</span></div>\n</div><br />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>柏林以东：</b></span><i>“……呼，下班！今晚不用去电台主持，可以早点回家！”</i><br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>柏林以东：</b></span><i>“那么，晚饭吃点什么好呢？”</i><br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>柏林以东：</b></span><i>“无论如何，等下路过百货店，我将奖励勤奋工作一天的自己——一整盒吕贝克杏仁糖！”</i><br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>少女一边计划着晚间食谱，一边迅速收拾随身小包。<br />\n恰好，交班的同事走了进来。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>柏林以东：</b></span>“晚上好，洛尔！你每次交班都好及时，谢谢你！”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>洛尔脸上扬起灿烂的笑容，她向柏林以东比了个“晚上好”的手势，柏林以东冲她弯起矢车菊蓝色的眼睛。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>柏林以东：</b></span>“我在后厨小桌上给你留了个‘巨无霸’汉堡，记得吃哦。”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>洛尔拿起员工服，郑重地比了个感谢的手势。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>柏林以东：</b></span>“不用谢！我想的是，万一你来不及吃晚饭的话——”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>她熟练地帮洛尔系上背后的系带，顺手打了个漂亮的花结。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>柏林以东：</b></span>“晚上加油！我先走啦！”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>洛尔笑眯眯地朝柏林以东挥了挥手。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"border: 1px solid; font-size: 14px; margin: 0 5px; display: inline-block; text-align: center; height: 20px; line-height: 18px; min-width: &#91;&#91;:模板:Width&#93;&#93;; color: #666; padding: 0 5px;\">07.04.1991 雨</span></div>\n<div style=\"position: relative; display: inline-block; max-width: 100%;\"><img alt=\"V3a1 rolestory game placebg.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png/400px-V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"41\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"588\" data-file-height=\"60\" />\n<div style=\"position: absolute; top: 38%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); white-space: nowrap;\"><img alt=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/15px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" width=\"15\" height=\"18\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/23px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"24\" data-file-height=\"28\" /><span style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; font-size: 14px;margin-left: 20px; color: #cccccc\">街道（傍晚）</span></div>\n</div><br />\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_3020_gamepic_11.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory 3020 gamepic 11.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Rolestory_3020_gamepic_11.png/130px-Rolestory_3020_gamepic_11.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"130\" height=\"73\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Rolestory_3020_gamepic_11.png/195px-Rolestory_3020_gamepic_11.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Rolestory_3020_gamepic_11.png/260px-Rolestory_3020_gamepic_11.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"754\" data-file-height=\"424\" /></a><br />\n傍晚时分，天色郁郁。<br />\n一路小跑，柏林以东终于赶在第一滴雨水落下前安全到家。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>柏林以东：</b></span><i>“呼——刚好！甚至还顺利买到了做晚饭的酸黄瓜罐头和我最爱的吕贝克杏仁糖。”</i><br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>隔着窗户，暮春的雨越下越急。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>柏林以东：</b></span><i>“一晃就到四月了，天气也变得难以捉摸起来，真就是那句：‘四月、四月，它想做什么就做什么。’”</i><br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>柏林以东：</b></span><i>“这么大的雨，那只筑巢的小雀还好吗……”</i><br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>柏林以东：</b></span><i>“还有桥洞里那些才开的黄水仙。”</i><br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>柏林以东：</b></span><i>“明天兼职送信的路上，我得去看看它们。”</i><br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>柏林以东：</b></span><i>“四月、四月，你也少些残忍吧……”</i><br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>在窗边静默片刻后，少女拿出一颗杏仁糖，含进嘴里，带着新买的酸黄瓜走进厨房。<br />\n厨房不大，厨具却一应俱全，台面锃亮。<br />\n柏林以东娴熟地处理食材，有条不紊地将它们放进锅里。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>柏林以东：</b></span><i>“现在随时都能吃到杏仁糖了，真好啊。”</i><br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>柏林以东：</b></span><i>“但还是以前的施普雷瓦尔德酸黄瓜更合我胃口。”</i><br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>柏林以东：</b></span><i>“人的口味真是奇怪！既怀旧，又图新鲜。”</i><br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>端着分量不大但美观营养的晚餐，她走回书桌边坐下，翻开日记本。<br />\n<small style=\"color: #999;\">翻开日记本</small><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_3020_gamepic_13_1.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory 3020 gamepic 13 1.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/Rolestory_3020_gamepic_13_1.png/130px-Rolestory_3020_gamepic_13_1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"130\" height=\"73\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/Rolestory_3020_gamepic_13_1.png/195px-Rolestory_3020_gamepic_13_1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/Rolestory_3020_gamepic_13_1.png/260px-Rolestory_3020_gamepic_13_1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"760\" data-file-height=\"424\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_3020_gamepic_13_2.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory 3020 gamepic 13 2.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/Rolestory_3020_gamepic_13_2.png/130px-Rolestory_3020_gamepic_13_2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"130\" height=\"73\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/Rolestory_3020_gamepic_13_2.png/195px-Rolestory_3020_gamepic_13_2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/Rolestory_3020_gamepic_13_2.png/260px-Rolestory_3020_gamepic_13_2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"754\" data-file-height=\"424\" /></a><br />\n<i style=\"display:block; color:#b2b2b2; border:1px dotted #bbb; border-radius:10px; padding:10px; width:fit-content\">\n<b><i>1991/4/7  雨</i></b><br />\n今天下班早，试着做了顿大餐。<br />\n来MFC后厨兼职还没多久，我很担心自己能不能适应——每次换工作都这样。<br />\n但幸好有洛尔在。她人可真好啊。<br />\n哈哈，只是在以前，我肯定会觉得她是个麻烦的任务对象。<br />\n毕竟“不能说话”的人更容易保守秘密。<br />\n加粗：没有冒犯洛尔的意思……虽然她是语言障碍者，但我很佩服她，也希望能和她成为真正的朋友。<br />\n毕竟友谊不需要支付秘密。友谊只需要彼此了解。<br />\n只是以前的我需要收取很多人的秘密，却不能被任何人了解。<br />\n唔，不过也不能说以前我没有朋友。<br />\n<b>老师</b>算半个吧……虽然是我单方面的。<br />\n还有上班途中常遇到的小松鼠一家、下班路上那棵漂亮的山毛榉、我不开心时爱躺上去的番红花草坪……<br />\n还有那位特别的任务对象……对她来说，我也能算是素未谋面的，“看不见的朋友”吗？<br />\n不过现在尝试各种新的工作，也有更多机会和新的人打交道。<br />\n除了快餐店，之前去杂货店收银、在邮局分发信件、给报社做兼职记者……虽然遇到了不少未曾设想的新麻烦，但也遇到了很多很好的人。<br />\n就算还称不上“朋友”，但主动的善意本就很难得了！<br />\n生活就像四月的天气。但花儿会扎根土地，稳稳地抓住小小的幸福。<br />\n唉，只是不知道，<b>老师</b>她还好吗……</i><br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<div style=\"position: relative; display: inline-block; max-width: 100%;\"><img alt=\"V3a1 rolestory game placebg.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png/400px-V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"41\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"588\" data-file-height=\"60\" />\n<div style=\"position: absolute; top: 38%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); white-space: nowrap;\"><img alt=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/15px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" width=\"15\" height=\"18\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/23px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"24\" data-file-height=\"28\" /><span style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; font-size: 14px;margin-left: 20px; color: #cccccc\">柏林以东家中（夜晚）</span></div>\n</div><br />\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>不知不觉已至深夜，柏林以东伸了个懒腰，合上日记本，站起身来。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>柏林以东：</b></span><i><b>“小花儿们早已入梦，<br />在那清幽的月影之中～♪”</b></i><br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>少女轻哼着歌，端着空盘，走进厨房。<br />\n她迅速洗净盘子，把它放回碗柜。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>柏林以东：</b></span><i><b>“它们轻轻低垂着头，<br />依偎在细细的茎上摇动～♪”</b></i><br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>她拿起静置一晚的喷壶，回到房间。<br />\n透过窗帘，街对面传来附近铁克诺俱乐部的声响，衬托得这边的夜晚越发安静。<br />\n雨后澄澈的夜色中，窗边的矢车菊茂盛生长着。<br />\n<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_3020_gamepic_03.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory 3020 gamepic 03.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/Rolestory_3020_gamepic_03.png/130px-Rolestory_3020_gamepic_03.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"130\" height=\"73\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/Rolestory_3020_gamepic_03.png/195px-Rolestory_3020_gamepic_03.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/Rolestory_3020_gamepic_03.png/260px-Rolestory_3020_gamepic_03.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"754\" data-file-height=\"424\" /></a><br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<div class=\"tabber\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"tabber-filter filter-button left auto-first\" style=\"\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"title\" data-title=\"浇水\">浇水</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"title\" data-title=\"不浇水\">不浇水</div></div>\n<div>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n</div><div class=\"tabber-item\" style=\"display: none;\" data-title=\"浇水\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_3020_gamepic_02.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory 3020 gamepic 02.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/Rolestory_3020_gamepic_02.png/130px-Rolestory_3020_gamepic_02.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"130\" height=\"73\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/Rolestory_3020_gamepic_02.png/195px-Rolestory_3020_gamepic_02.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/Rolestory_3020_gamepic_02.png/260px-Rolestory_3020_gamepic_02.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"760\" data-file-height=\"424\" /></a><br />\n</p>\n</div><div class=\"tabber-item\" style=\"display: none;\" data-title=\"不浇水\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_3020_gamepic_01.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory 3020 gamepic 01.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7c/Rolestory_3020_gamepic_01.png/130px-Rolestory_3020_gamepic_01.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"130\" height=\"72\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7c/Rolestory_3020_gamepic_01.png/195px-Rolestory_3020_gamepic_01.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7c/Rolestory_3020_gamepic_01.png/260px-Rolestory_3020_gamepic_01.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"754\" data-file-height=\"419\" /></a><br />\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>柏林以东：</b></span><i><b>“繁花树影轻轻晃，<br />如梦般的低语在回响～♪”</b></i><br />\n</p>\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>柏林以东：</b></span><i><b>“小花儿，好好长大吧。”</b></i><br /></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "矢车菊说起的那一年-02"}}